% SPDX-License-Identifier: EUPL-1.2
% =====================================================================
% citations.clausal -- statutory citation records for sg/tax/gst_registration.
%
% citation/2 record form: a FACT, the key an atom, the second argument a
% pair list with keys label and ref only:
%   citation(Key, [label-'...', ref-'...']).
% Records carry a label and a link; quotations of the statute are omitted,
% see the linked Singapore Statutes Online (SSO) page for the text.
%
% A clause cites a key with a `cite(Key)` term; cite(...) is data and
% needs no import.
%
% PROVENANCE: every clause that decides a statutory condition or computes a
% statutory value (a threshold, a test, an exception, a classification,
% a list it filters by, a date or amount, a definition or interpretation
% rule it applies), helpers included, opens its body with implements(Key),
% Key the provision for THAT condition or value; the verdict clause's
% umbrella section does not cover the conditions below it.
% =====================================================================

:- module(citations, [
    citation/2,
    implements/1
]).

% --- GST Act 1993, First Schedule ---

citation(sg_gsta_1993_sch1_para_1_1, [
    label-'Goods and Services Tax Act 1993, First Schedule, paragraph 1(1)',
    ref-'https://sso.agc.gov.sg/Act/GSTA1993'
]).

